Description: Argon ONE V5 Essential Case & Performance Configuration (Raspberry Pi 5)
 Configures all hardware features and safe performance optimizations for the
 Argon ONE V5 Raspberry Pi 5 case (works both with and without the OLED module):
  - Front USB 2.0 ports (dwc2 host mode) and full USB current budget
  - UART0 shutdown detection for clean case power-cut
  - M.2 NVMe slot activation and PCIe Gen 3 speed
  - Safe 2800 MHz CPU boost (V3D GPU left at standard)
  - Responsive 4-stage kernel PWM fan curve (0% CPU overhead)
  - Fast CPU governor ramp-up, NVMe multiqueue ('none') & RAM/cache sysctl tuning
